    "name":  "Pack LED Controller CCT - RGB - 12-24V + Remote Control - 2.4GHz",
    "reference":  "PACK-E3-RF-FUT092",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eController Pack 2.4GHz (12-24V) + 2.4GHz remote control\u003c/strong\u003e allows switching between 3 output modes \u003cstrong\u003e(RGB / RGBW / RGB+CCT)\u003c/strong\u003e via a button. Control each LED individually, adjusting speed, brightness, direction, length, and dynamic modes. Enjoy smart animations and customize colors and pixels for detailed effects. Its wiring is instant and tool-free, with a control distance of up to 30m. Offers adjustable brightness and color temperature.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003ePack LED Controller CCT - RGB - 12-24V + Remote Control - 2.4GHz\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2.4GHz controller (12-24V) + 2.4GHz remote control - advanced versatile solution for LED strips. Switch between three output modes: RGB, RGBW, and RGB+CCT with a button.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1. Variable Output Modes: RGB/RGBW/RGB+CCT\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. Individual LED Control: Speed, brightness, direction, length, dynamic modes\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3. Smart Animations\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4. Detailed Customization: Adjustable colors and pixels\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e5. Easy Installation: Tool-free instant wiring\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e6. Long Range Remote Control: Up to 30m\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e7. Brightness and Color Temperature Adjustments\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIdeal for creative home lighting projects to professional commercial installations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#2445a2;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis controller is ONLY compatible with 5m LED strip (1 roll).\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
